# Outer Breakwater (CIPlay outer_breakwater): the ground at 2 m either side of the wall (z -6); the gate house, the
# keeper's book (no step), the cistern, the pipe store, the gate crank (twice), the keeper's chest, the wall store, the
# inner stair.
island Outer Breakwater
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Wall
zone gate_house
expect step 1
read Wall keeper's book
expect step 1
open Rain cistern
wait 3
expect step 2
open Pipe store
wait 3
expect step 3
expect shown gate
use gatecrank
expect story gate 1
expect hidden gate
use gatecrank
expect story gate 1
expect step 4
open Keeper's chest
wait 3
expect step 5
open Wall store
wait 3
expect step 6
zone eastridge
expect step 7
use smuglever
expect message curtain of vines
use smugvines
expect hidden smugvines
use smuglever
expect story smugbolt 1
expect step 8
read Masons' plan
open Smugglers' strongbox
wait 3
expect step 9
read Storm plane log
expect step 10
# (deep pass 10-24: the top locker refuses, the dive, the air bell, the dive chest, the buried tins, the tower)
open Watch tower locker
expect message bolted from inside
zone ob_dive
expect step 11
air ob_air
open Smugglers' boat
wait 3
expect story ledger 1
expect step 12
open Boat hold box
wait 3
dig 3
climb 42.7 59.85
open Watch tower stash
wait 3
read Garden cairn
dig 2
zone ob_top
expect step 13
open Watch tower locker
wait 3
expect step 14
expect story chainkey 1
zone inner_stair
expect done
